{"4941730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Walk Home", "steam_appid": 4941730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk Home is a 5-minute psychological horror experience that puts you in the shoes of a young teenage girl, experiencing deeply unsettling circumstances as she navigates an eerie dirt trail back to her rural home late at night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and retro graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommendations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 'late-night game' designed to be played in low-to-no-light conditions. It is recommended to play alone with the lights turned off to build atmospheric tension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Walk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift - Run </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse Button - Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Mouse Button - Zoom</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk Home is a 5-minute psychological horror experience that puts you in the shoes of a young teenage girl, experiencing deeply unsettling circumstances as she navigates an eerie dirt trail back to her rural home late at night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and retro graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommendations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 'late-night game' designed to be played in low-to-no-light conditions. It is recommended to play alone with the lights turned off to build atmospheric tension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p clas